{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up in the darkness of a cold, unfamiliar cellar, with the distant echo of footsteps that shouldn't be there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/e1efab22ae48eddab045a26bb3b2cb9d.poster.avif?t=1768305689\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/e1efab22ae48eddab045a26bb3b2cb9d.webm?t=1768305689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/e1efab22ae48eddab045a26bb3b2cb9d.mp4?t=1768305689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanguis Luna</strong> throws you into a living nightmare, where every shadow hides a secret and every sound fills you with growing terror.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/269c5b6298ca580fbc177b774717c90f.poster.avif?t=1768305689\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/269c5b6298ca580fbc177b774717c90f.webm?t=1768305689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/269c5b6298ca580fbc177b774717c90f.mp4?t=1768305689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone, with no memory of how you ended up in that cursed house, but one thing is certain: someone, or something, is watching you. The walls of this ancient dwelling whisper stories of blood and pain, but every time you think you've found a way out, a familiar sensation chills your veins: an unsettling d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu that keeps dragging you back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/917746b5d41e646c1bc6d8cd4c10f331.poster.avif?t=1768305689\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/917746b5d41e646c1bc6d8cd4c10f331.webm?t=1768305689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/917746b5d41e646c1bc6d8cd4c10f331.mp4?t=1768305689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you try to understand the nature of this dark presence, the more the line between reality and madness dissolves, pulling you into a vortex of fear and despair.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/9761bc41a2eda9683043dcbdd081d170.poster.avif?t=1768305689\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/9761bc41a2eda9683043dcbdd081d170.webm?t=1768305689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/9761bc41a2eda9683043dcbdd081d170.mp4?t=1768305689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tension is palpable, the darkness is your enemy, and time is a luxury you can't afford.<br>Every corner could hide a clue to your salvation... or a horror ready to consume you. <br>Your only hope? Find a way out before the darkness closes in on you forever.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810670?t=1768305689","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810670?t=1768305689","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/ec80596d59e564e5dfcca9275f97c5dcef046574/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768305689","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/ec80596d59e564e5dfcca9275f97c5dcef046574/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768305689","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up in the darkness of a cold, unfamiliar cellar, with the distant echo of footsteps that shouldn't be there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/e1efab22ae48eddab045a26bb3b2cb9d.poster.avif?t=1768305689\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/e1efab22ae48eddab045a26bb3b2cb9d.webm?t=1768305689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/e1efab22ae48eddab045a26bb3b2cb9d.mp4?t=1768305689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanguis Luna</strong> throws you into a living nightmare, where every shadow hides a secret and every sound fills you with growing terror.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/269c5b6298ca580fbc177b774717c90f.poster.avif?t=1768305689\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/269c5b6298ca580fbc177b774717c90f.webm?t=1768305689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/269c5b6298ca580fbc177b774717c90f.mp4?t=1768305689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone, with no memory of how you ended up in that cursed house, but one thing is certain: someone, or something, is watching you. The walls of this ancient dwelling whisper stories of blood and pain, but every time you think you've found a way out, a familiar sensation chills your veins: an unsettling d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu that keeps dragging you back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/917746b5d41e646c1bc6d8cd4c10f331.poster.avif?t=1768305689\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/917746b5d41e646c1bc6d8cd4c10f331.webm?t=1768305689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/917746b5d41e646c1bc6d8cd4c10f331.mp4?t=1768305689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you try to understand the nature of this dark presence, the more the line between reality and madness dissolves, pulling you into a vortex of fear and despair.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/9761bc41a2eda9683043dcbdd081d170.poster.avif?t=1768305689\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/9761bc41a2eda9683043dcbdd081d170.webm?t=1768305689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/extras/9761bc41a2eda9683043dcbdd081d170.mp4?t=1768305689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tension is palpable, the darkness is your enemy, and time is a luxury you can't afford.<br>Every corner could hide a clue to your salvation... or a horror ready to consume you. <br>Your only hope? Find a way out before the darkness closes in on you forever.</p>","developers":["Domynyo SRL"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810670/b3c388ec0b743cc3e8bb52dcbcad5dffc69dae10/header.jpg?t=1768305689","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9DOMYNYO\u2122","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810670/389912841/f9af9f7a89d83e2eeba603b5fa49498701542a0d/1750364995/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749688360","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810670/389912841/f9af9f7a89d83e2eeba603b5fa49498701542a0d/1750364995/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749688360","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810670/389912841/f9af9f7a89d83e2eeba603b5fa49498701542a0d/1750364995/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749688360","id":257154574,"name":"Trailer - Sanguis Luna","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat